# inbox: the closed list of states of the machine "Inbox and steer".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
stored	initial	waiting	the message is on record and nobody was told
rung	-	waiting	the target was told that a message waits
read	-	waiting	the target took the message
handled	final	final	the target acted on it and said how
failed	final	final	the message could not be delivered
